@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = local-dev-key
@seasonId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health (also shows this key's role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dmap/health
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### The whole guide
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dmap/guide
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### What changed after guide version 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dmap/changes?since=0
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Create a season (baseVersion 0 = new page)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/dmap/records/season/{{seasonId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-User-Name: Tester
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseVersion": 0,
  "data": { "Number": 9, "Title": "Test season", "Year": "", "Description": "" }
}

### Save it again from version 1 (a second save from version 1 gets 409 Conflict)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/dmap/records/season/{{seasonId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-User-Name: Tester
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseVersion": 1,
  "data": { "Number": 9, "Title": "Renamed season", "Year": "", "Description": "" }
}

### Delete it (and anything inside it)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/dmap/records/season/{{seasonId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
